# Plugin build follow-ups

- Apply plugin line-ending normalization to the hand-edit check before comparing checkout bytes with sentinel hashes; keep `.bat` and `.cmd` byte-faithful.
- Move sentinel serialization and writing from `src/build/plugin/output.rs` into `plugin_metadata` so one owner controls its format.
- Define an exclusion policy or warn for author-gitignored files in skill directories: fingerprinting and shipping them can make a clean clone disagree with the sentinel.
